<div class="container">
    <header class="cv-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">zv0ndis.github.io</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>The short version</h2>
        <p>
            This is a personal site. It has no analytics, no advertising, no tracking scripts and
            no cookies. Nothing you do here is recorded or sent anywhere, and there is no account
            for visitors to create.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>What is stored</h2>
        <p>
            The Semester page reads its dates — the start and end of the semester and the two exam
            periods — from a Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore) database. That is the only data the
            site holds, it is entered by the site owner, and it is the same for everyone. It
            contains nothing about you.
        </p>
        <p>
            Only the site owner can sign in and change those dates. Everyone else has read-only
            access, which is enforced by the database's own security rules rather than by the page.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
        <p>
            Two small preferences are kept in your browser's local storage: which language you last
            chose, so the home page can offer it again, and — if you are the site owner — your sign-in
            session. Local storage is not a cookie, is never transmitted to the site, and you can
            clear it at any time through your browser settings.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Third parties</h2>
        <p>
            The Semester page connects to Google Firebase to fetch those dates, so Google receives
            the request as the database host. No other third-party service is contacted — fonts and
            all scripts are served from this site itself.
        </p>
        <p>
            The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, so GitHub may keep standard server logs of requests,
            as any web host does.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Questions about this policy can be sent to
            <a href="mailto:zvondatom@gmail.com">zvondatom@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
    </section>
</div>
